        {
          "id": "88f90d88-fd48-4a6b-ac1d-62ac67e17a24",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute a frase.</p><p><strong>Los lunes estudio español a las siete.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Às segundas eu estudo espanhol às sete.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a3cce60acb3b4bcfa41d6f863ab46a5a_b01-los-lunes-estudio-espanol-a-las-siete.mp3?Expires=1794099467&Signature=QA1q28adht4gMojLXj2TPXGWlof~9~YZflOrReeLQwuuVOFnJSteY8Ezc4cqqlafIVqEnQVZ~mFZWSZenlJzuHtNwk2D1lz3108GStq9midoHAXQXzpr4NMOz4IKpELJeb66-Wj9Se8C4bGAxUJfxzjsx1vSojA1RxGnqKBW~Ps1EA~ivL-VaSIO9BE4Ua27-zM0HSwvSnFdGKekH1nRQJEx0nAM-I1y5N5MbNktlXKRGjcrKabeUUUGb7ir41KZspucSrKi2ZTnFs0Q29Kyia~q5~ZA-MNLTVu4jKZhtrgL3aJdmdTH6uevPm9ArgFncSs6yEHv7L-9F1PtAe4FDA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
