    {
      "id": "3993fcfa-a19a-4426-b4aa-249c6caac9da",
      "title": "Observe como dia, atividade e horário aparecem na frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "3b094b68-7d26-4e9c-92b5-dd70db18ac62",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a ordem da frase.</p><ul><li><strong>Los lunes</strong>: o dia</li><li><strong>estudio español</strong>: a atividade</li><li><strong>a las siete</strong>: o horário</li></ul><p>Esse formato ajuda a falar de um compromisso fixo da sua semana.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "78322c5b-c042-4531-b2e1-44c7961a46ef",
      "title": "Escute e acompanhe a nova frase em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "3086c0c2-9c4f-45d2-9a84-3a709820d42c",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora veja o mesmo tipo de frase com <strong>una</strong>.</p><p><strong>Los miércoles tengo clase a la una.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Às quartas eu tenho aula à uma.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/725054258019408fba8c7285666653d2_b03-los-miercoles-tengo-clase-a-la-una.mp3?Expires=1794099467&Signature=ZVC5Bvbnp6ltRwDV2Mqh48Uar3BH6pvikT04EOiemOVzTyqAuXMZ0O7BkUsVpyzAHBuSQeelMXw7LQfShIzkFflRSYbNW38v1Rz-TUWSg0oVtvf7hUOSc1Sp4E9RAkLPwqvSD5lXP2r~xw278JQfxR7NC7O-Hp-64BbxiFlb70huczZd5hyfMchoMvtk1kbt2Ic6TK8mciAD57nHY~8ttt2QxN6mqyQap89hmYzBnOHDuzB2EpRzsy1iYulTtBHwjEcSFtaAkkGhWj7c4JokHgDN66vXbu-gE68qlBBvdy5f2WWJoczcs9LFvK6aNLbMoOvlqvi0gGnH62QjvrSMtQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
