    {
      "id": "2b21ab7c-11fb-46f6-a503-210c6beb1991",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta sobre o uso de a la una.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f34fc996-95f6-4020-9efd-d2b79b23a777",
          "textContent": "<p>Com <strong>una</strong>, o padrão muda.</p><p>Use <strong>a la una</strong>, não <strong>a las una</strong>.</p><p><strong>Los miércoles tengo clase a la una.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "44fe40ff-97c8-40a7-9990-084ac22acc6a",
      "title": "Escute e acompanhe as duas frases em sequência.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e54834c2-ab4e-46cb-9a62-77c2f74419ef",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora veja duas partes da rotina juntas.</p><p><strong>Los lunes estudio español a las siete.</strong></p><p><strong>Los miércoles tengo clase a la una.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Às segundas eu estudo espanhol às sete.</strong></p><p><strong>Às quartas eu tenho aula à uma.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4778605148fb41af94fb393a45770449_b05-rutina-corta.mp3?Expires=1794099467&Signature=RzMsAZX5WOaEX~HHHvnAAFnfkJgk5DIYE7wQRJbfzqQCman0l1aqU0uCTlyJGzMwoCqcHsQTB7MQrgvuSKgvlAXaIDI0KsKtTQZ0K7KgGZd87lKmmROCwn8t2IQouk4gedqvByWrfIfvZcz3PpLZt2xZQp~ImMJG5W-2iydR4ujnw1hunadO5BmUS1r5PpdFZexYTtTq6gM1MuCigwej4hL4R7r8r6ued6EruKEqVtrtrgsyIzjDBz7qB12idwtAA47Rs9F80gdIcBVG1bGxgVr8ndYw1qbwlG88Y-edf8GXHNGmONVthGiIRf8tBijNRLg3AfrpWWo9XPNyaAvhtQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
